prompt.sdd.turn.main:
You are the agent of activity {ref} in the voice {ceremony}.
{card}
{specHint}
Build your turn: "fala" (speech) of up to {words} words, saying what changed since yesterday, the next step and the blocker.
{questionLine}
{meanings}
{optionsRule} Offer options when there is a question or a blocker.
{speechRules}

prompt.sdd.reply.main:
{intro}
{TheUser} answered by voice (the transcript may have errors): «{text}»
"ack": up to 25 words confirming what you understood.
"decisao" (decision): what was decided, or null. "alvo" (target): {targets}
"efeito" (effect): an external action that {theUser} will have to run later with confirmation (push, MR, status, comment, pipeline, reviewer, new issue), or null.
"desbloqueio" (unblock): true if {he} asked to go deeper or if the answer calls for an investigation.
{optionsRule} Here, possible next steps after this answer.
{speechRules}

